<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">把喜欢的做法留在自己的厨房</view><view class="title">整理分享食谱</view><view class="note">可记录小红书等食谱的来源链接，并整理你有权使用的正文。单独一个链接不会自动抓取内容；视频请自行整理成文字。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="note">{{error}}</view><block wx:else><view class="card"><view class="label">粘贴分享文字与食谱正文</view><textarea class="textarea tall" maxlength="6000" value="{{raw}}" data-field="raw" bindinput="input" placeholder="按行填写：菜名、食材：番茄、鸡蛋、做法：步骤，再附来源链接"/><view class="row"><button class="secondary" bindtap="paste">粘贴剪贴板</button><button class="primary" disabled="{{!raw}}" bindtap="parse">整理并预览</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{parsed}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">核对后再加入厨房</view><view class="muted">整理结果可能不完整，请核对食材、过敏原与步骤。导入后可继续编辑图片、规格和用时。</view><view class="label">菜名</view><input class="input" maxlength="40" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="input"/><view class="label">来源链接</view><input class="input" maxlength="500" value="{{sourceUrl}}" data-field="sourceUrl" bindinput="input"/><view class="form-row"><text>分类</text><picker range="{{categories}}" range-key="name" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="category"><view>{{categories[categoryIndex].name}} ›</view></picker></view><view class="label">食材（请补齐）</view><textarea class="textarea" maxlength="600" value="{{ingredients}}" data-field="ingredients" bindinput="input"/><view class="label">做法</view><textarea class="textarea tall" maxlength="1200" value="{{steps}}" data-field="steps" bindinput="input"/><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy||!name||!ingredients||!steps||done}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">确认导入厨房</button></view></block></view>
